/S /P
/P 155 0 R
/E (Fixing the gaps in the supply chain between production and consumption within BRICS+ nations can eliminate waste and foster trade. Creating regional frameworks that will improve food banks, school feeding programs, and public buffer stocks. Combating the loss of food will allow food insecurity to decrease.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [10]
>>
